### Create Maintenance Request
POST http://localhost:5000/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Rahul",
    "contactNumber": "9876543210",
    "serviceType": "Plumbing",
    "description": "Kitchen tap leakage",
    "preferredDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### Get All Maintenance Requests
GET http://localhost:5000/api/requests


### Get Request by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/requests/MR002

### Update Maintenance Request
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/requests/MR001
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "technician": "Amit",
    "estimatedCost": 1500,
    "status": "Assigned",
    "note": "Technician assigned to the request"
}

### Delete Maintenance Request
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/requests/MR001

### Invalid Date Range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/requests?startDate=2026-11-14&endDate=2026-11-10

### Invalid Cost Range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/requests?minCost=2000&maxCost=500